prompt:
Our distributed key-value store loses writes during network partitions. Here is the replication logic:
```go
func (n *Node) Put(k, v string) error {
  n.local[k] = v
  for _, p := range n.peers { go p.Replicate(k, v) }
  return nil
}
```
Analyze the consistency guarantees, explain exactly how writes are lost, and design a fix with quorum reads and writes. Justify the trade-offs for latency and availability.
